{"id":"vod_jy_107102","vodId":"107102","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"欢迎来到实力至上主义教室第四季","name_cn":"欢迎来到实力至上主义教室第四季","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第16集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/f7d7776254e4b53becc57ef565d84a1e.jpg"},"summary":"故事讲述了被分到问题学生云集的D班的绫小路清隆和他的同学们在学校里挣扎求生的故事。在TV动画第四季《欢迎来到实力至上主义教室 第四季：二年级第一学期》中，春假过后，绫小路和轻井泽成为了情侣，而堀北也不再崇拜她才华横溢的哥哥岳。随着他们关系的逐渐变化，他们也升入了二年级。绫小路和其他二年级新生即将迎来他们的第一场特殊考试——笔试，他们将与一年级新生搭档。然而，一年级新生中竟潜伏着月城从白屋派来的刺客。这种跨越年级界限的全新关系，究竟会带来风暴还是平静？校园生活的第二年就此拉开帷幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-24 22:56:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkRZkLXa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e5y9kzRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/axkvArJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eER9EVNa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bmZQJORd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dyPr0Nwb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ejRZ0Wye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eVOAZXMa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ejRZWnBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJZ0jGd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e31QkmRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2Q2zra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/azp6nEOd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2QJBra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dNkO67Le/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/azp6OAYd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:56:57.645Z"}